  "notes": "USAGE:\n{搾取|さくしゅ} carries a strongly negative, critical nuance. It is commonly used in political, economic, and social justice contexts. The word derives from the idea of \"squeezing\" (like wringing juice from fruit), applied metaphorically to extracting value from people.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {労働|ろうどう}{搾取|さくしゅ}: labor exploitation\n- {搾取|さくしゅ}{構造|こうぞう}: exploitative structure\n- {搾取|さくしゅ}される: to be exploited (passive)\n- {富|とみ}を{搾取|さくしゅ}する: to exploit wealth/resources",
